 & Packs!\n- Make a Unique Style to show off to Friends!\n\nGames \ud83c\udfae\n- Zero Gravity | Float around in Space!\n- Spot Battles | Fight other Spots with swords while avoiding lava!\n- Nextbots | Get chased around by memes!\n- Colour Game | Stand on the right colour tile before it gets too late!\n\nNews \ud83d\udcf0\n- Get regular updates from Blessed Analytics!\n- Stay up-to-date to what's happening!\n\nThere is so many more stuff to explore in this game. What are you wating for?", "short_description": "Become a Spot"}]}, "developer_name": "Blessed Analytics", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1h-TiPEj091YizguawIzMY2qS-U_sFa4k5o59AMJUUOQ/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BLESS!", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spot-runners-meta/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26959818750377194"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825470_1671029384047392_2680774296347937269_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PxxaEtgf29EQ7kNvwGT775i&_nc_oc=AdrR_5Ce7qdH0LhNdilJJ8MhOlNxHs3F56RSxX4H3ZAu4X7Xt2O85x3LyofiHntizUc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ARF308K0V8yM8APj1gwkhPUv19EiFaFPJB-o